$NetBSD$

EmberBSD, AI-assisted; not submitted upstream.
Use the same declared target platform as the common Tcl provider.
Native builds retain uname. Feature probes still use the compiler.
Do not select NetBSD-Debian from the build host's /etc/debian_version.
Keep the maintained Autoconf inputs and release-generated script together.

